((date 2026-11-14) (slug price-band-confirm)
 (hypothesis
  "Price-band tiebreak confirmation (pre-registered in dev/experiments/price-band-confirm-2026-11-13/README.md at 04ca2ff0b, #3598; read #3610): two K = 5 paired cells of the record config (S, Seeded tie order seed K) against S + candidate_ranking Price_band_seeded (P, edges [8;14;33]); C1 2013-01-01 -> 2026-06-26 on the top-3000 PIT v12 schedule (no 2010-12 entry can count), C2 2000-01-01 -> 2026-06-26 on the top-1000 PIT v12 schedule. Per cell, in order: V6 exit 0 and n_symbols_absent=1 per pair; liveness on the post-cut lists (B = share of Friday-pairs whose lists differ >= 33 %, G = >= $33 share of S-not-P minus P-not-S names >= 40 pp, >= 100 Friday-pairs), else NOT LIVE; return PASS at median delta ln(1+R) >= max(0.20, m_S) with >= 4/5 seeds positive, FAIL at median <= 0 or <= 2 seeds positive, else short; drawdown median(maxDD_P) - median(maxDD_S) <= 3.0 pp; concentration trim-3 one-arm net > 0 in >= 4/5 seeds. Cell: NOT LIVE / FAIL / PASS / INCONCLUSIVE. Combined: PASS+PASS ESCALATE; either FAIL NO-BUILD; both NOT LIVE NOT LIVE; else INCONCLUSIVE.")
